        "created_at": "2026-02-27T12:15:07.721Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi</p>\n<p>I wanted to ask if I can use kali Linux for my system command’s assignments, BPT and oppe. I am currently using kali linux via oracle virtual machine in my laptop and when I tried to log in COURSE VM using the ssh key that I generated in the same ,  I successfully logged in . Now I am wondering that Will it be okay to give my oppe and bpts in kali linux ? Will there be any problem during OPPE ?As linux commands are working just fine… Should I continue using it or just switch to the Ubuntu as in course?</p>",
